      "short_description": "<p>Whole beans from Black Moon Farm in Panama. It is an anaerobic natural Chiroso.</p>\n<p>100g</p>\n<p>Roasted on 05/10/2026</p>",
      "description": "<p>Whole beans from Black Moon Farm. It is a chiroso variety anaerobic natural.<br />\nA few hours after roasting, Joachim wrote down the following notes :</p>\n<ul>\n<li>When hot, it is orange, clémentine with red fruits.</li>\n<li>When warm, more red fruits, blood orange, blackurrant.</li>\n<li>When cold, it stays very orange.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Country : Panama<br />\nRegion : Alto Quiel<br />\nFarm : Black Moon Farm<br />\nProducers : Hunter Tedman<br />\nProcessed by : Linda Michelle Arauz<br />\nAltitude : 1700m<br />\nSoil : volcanic<br />\nVariety : Chiroso<br />\nProcess : anaerobic natural<br />\nHarvest date : 23/02/2026<br />\nWet mill process date : 23/02/2026<br />\nDrying process date : 26/02/2026-25/03/2026<br />\nImport : direct trade with Hunter Tedman</p>\n<p>We got to visit Black Moon Farm during our January 2026 trip. It is a small 9 hectares farm owned by Hunter Tedman, used to grow vegetables. In 2018, a few geishas was planted. There was difficulties with the soil and the use of fertilizers was not a good idea. Biodynamic didn’t work either. Then Hunter started to do analysis on the soil and used syntropic agriculture and agroforestry to increase its quality. The analysis helped him to understand which compound was missing. They make their own compost with specific addition.<br />\nHe grows geisha, chorizo but also pink bourbon and wush wush.</p>\n<p>Photos taken by us at the farms.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-3956 size-large\" src=\"https://www.substancecafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_8453-576x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"576\" height=\"1024\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-3957 size-large\" src=\"https://www.substancecafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_8478-768x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"773\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-3958 size-large\" src=\"https://www.substancecafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_8486-768x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"773\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-3959 size-large\" src=\"https://www.substancecafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_8496-768x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"773\" /></p>",
